<title>POLAND: Poland offers PLN 450 mln 12-pct bonds on July 17.</title>
<headline>Poland offers PLN 450 mln 12-pct bonds on July 17.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland is offering 450 million zlotys worth of its 12-percent five-year bonds, maturing October 12, 2001 at a tender for institutional investors on July 17, the National Bank of Poland said.</p>
<p>Payment for the paper is on August 5, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
